      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FABULOUS JONES (5) did a good job to finish third last time out over 525m at The Meadows (30.67) in a Maiden, the second top-three finish on the trot. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. WAH GUM (4) is a first starter from the Korie-Lee Heinrich kennel by Shima Shine out of Jenny Wah. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. WAH JARRAH (1) is a debutante for the Korie-Lee Heinrich kennel and profiles well for first outing. Ratings suggest a place chance. VISTA HOIST (8) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance – sure to have admirers.",
